      {
        "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable had once asked Heavenly Court for human qi Immortal Gu and failed. He then refined imitation Gu, turned it into human qi Immortal Gu, and used that Gu as the core when he established Eighty-Eight True Yang Building.",
