  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the true inheritance secluded domain of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Mo Yao’s will names a burning white unparalleled true inheritance that holds a rank seven Immortal Gu Giant Sun Immortal Venerable personally refined, called human qi Gu. The same stretch also calls it man qi Gu and man qi Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          600
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "char_mo_yao",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Giant Sun’s will mobilizes the human qi Immortal Gu in the true inheritance secluded domain. A white light shines on Tai Bai Yun Sheng, and the Gu increases his human qi, raising future potential after he becomes a Gu Immortal. His human qi inflates by ten times.",
        "chapters": [
          608
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tai-bai-yun-shengs-ascension",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Even with that help, his human qi later runs nearly exhausted during the same advancement.",
        "chapters": [
          609
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tai-bai-yun-shengs-ascension",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later recalls that as a mortal he could not get close to the rank seven human qi Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          617
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tai-bai-yun-shengs-ascension",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He also recalls that Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s human qi surpassed his own because of that Gu’s help.",
        "chapters": [
          633
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tai-bai-yun-shengs-ascension",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
